499
00:25:41,867 --> 00:25:48,900
["PRINSESA" CONTINUES]

500
00:26:17,333 --> 00:26:20,500
Why are you so invested?
What's in it for you?

501
00:26:20,633 --> 00:26:22,033
Excuse me?

502
00:26:22,167 --> 00:26:23,800
Are you getting paid? You're
getting paid, aren't you?

503
00:26:23,933 --> 00:26:25,000
Wow.

504
00:26:25,133 --> 00:26:27,533
Are you even thinking?
How would a ghost pay us?

505
00:26:27,667 --> 00:26:29,467
Nadia! Nadia!

506
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:31,433
- Oh my gosh!
- It's Treb!

507
00:26:31,567 --> 00:26:33,067
Please get out.

508
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,767
If anything happens to Grandma,
you'll be held responsible.

509
00:26:34,900 --> 00:26:38,967
It just hurts that I can't
even talk to her or hold her.

510
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:42,933
Well-- Well, you could...

511
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:47,833
But only evil spirits
can do that.

512
00:26:48,700 --> 00:26:49,800
Treb?

513
00:26:53,467 --> 00:26:55,033
How's your sister?

514
00:26:57,300 --> 00:26:58,333
Jaja, I'm useless.

515
00:27:01,667 --> 00:27:03,367
I'm useless.

516
00:27:03,500 --> 00:27:05,300
I'm useless.

517
00:27:05,433 --> 00:27:07,867
I'm useless.
I'm so useless!
